# Tenko live media: the installer owns tty1.
#
# This file must sort before 50-tenko-console.preset: preset files are read
# in lexical order and the first matching line wins, so an enable of
# kmsconvt@.service (or of tenko-firstboot-root-password.service in the
# 90-tenko-firstboot preset) would otherwise take tty1 away from the
# installer and leave only a login prompt on the screen.
disable kmsconvt@tty1.service
disable tenko-firstboot-root-password.service
enable tenko-installer.service
